{
  "title": "SIMIAN",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A ten-voice drum",
        "synth. No samples:",
        "every sound is built",
        "from an oscillator,",
        "noise and a click.",
        "",
        "One envelope drags",
        "pitch and filter",
        "down as it falls.",
        "That fall is the",
        "drum.",
        "",
        "Ported from OneTrick",
        "SIMIAN 2 by Punk",
        "Labs. GPL-3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "The layout",
          "lines": [
            "16 pads, 10 drums.",
            "",
            "48 TomH* 49 Crash",
            "50 Crash* 51 TomM*",
            "44 TomH  45 TomL*",
            "46 OpHat 47 TomM",
            "40 Clap  41 TomL",
            "42 ClHat 43 ClHat*",
            "36 Kick  37 Rim",
            "38 Snare 39 Snare*",
            "",
            "* = a second pad on",
            "a drum another pad",
            "already owns."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Linked pads",
          "lines": [
            "Six pads share a",
            "drum with the pad",
            "beside them. The",
            "screen shows a link",
            "under the name.",
            "",
            "They share every",
            "control EXCEPT Tune.",
            "Turn Snare's Decay",
            "and both pads move:",
            "there is one snare.",
            "",
            "Tune is what makes",
            "the second pad worth",
            "having. It is the",
            "2nd knob on Tone."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Chokes",
          "lines": [
            "The three hats cut",
            "each other off, and",
            "so do the two",
            "cymbals.",
            "",
            "A pad never chokes",
            "itself. Hitting one",
            "drum twice just",
            "retriggers it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Not GM notes",
          "lines": [
            "The layout follows",
            "Move's own drum",
            "racks, not General",
            "MIDI.",
            "",
            "A GM drum loop from",
            "elsewhere will play",
            "the wrong drums."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tone page",
      "lines": [
        "Tune   this PAD's",
        "       offset, +-24",
        "Pitch  30Hz - 4.4k",
        "Wave   triangle to",
        "       cymbal, a",
        "       crossfade",
        "Bend   envelope to",
        "       pitch, +-36",
        "BendDyn how much of",
        "       that is",
        "       velocity",
        "Decay  10ms - 2s",
        "Punch  envelope",
        "       shape, not",
        "       length",
        "",
        "A soft hit always",
        "decays quicker: the",
        "lightest is 30% of",
        "the time you set."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Noise page",
      "lines": [
        "Cutoff 440Hz - 15k",
        "Res    emphasis, up",
        "       to about Q2",
        "LPBend envelope to",
        "       cutoff",
        "LPDyn  velocity over",
        "       that sweep",
        "Tone/Nse crossfade,",
        "       osc to noise",
        "Click  a transient",
        "       over the",
        "       attack",
        "",
        "Tone/Nse is the most",
        "defining knob here.",
        "Low is a kick, mid a",
        "snare, high a hat.",
        "",
        "Click is the stick.",
        "It is most of what",
        "makes a quiet drum",
        "audible in a mix."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mix page",
      "lines": [
        "Volume -60 to +6 dB",
        "Pan",
        "VelVol how much",
        "       velocity sets",
        "       the level",
        "Sat    on this drum",
        "       alone",
        "Reverb send to the",
        "       built-in verb",
        "SendA  host return",
        "SendB  host return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Master page",
      "lines": [
        "Gain   output level",
        "Drive  into the",
        "       limiter, -6",
        "       by default",
        "Sat    across the",
        "       whole mix",
        "RevSize verb decay",
        "RevGate a threshold.",
        "       -100 is never",
        "       gated. Raise",
        "       it for the",
        "       gated snare.",
        "VelSens 0 plays flat",
        "Transpose +-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Performance",
      "lines": [
        "Mod wheel sweeps",
        "every drum's cutoff",
        "down up to 32",
        "semitones. A DJ",
        "filter over the kit.",
        "",
        "Pitch wheel scales",
        "every decay, 20% to",
        "180%. A staccato",
        "control, not a bend.",
        "It is not saved."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Kits",
      "lines": [
        "35 factory kits on",
        "the Kit page, all",
        "from OneTrick",
        "SIMIAN 2.",
        "",
        "They are only",
        "parameter sets, so",
        "anything you hear",
        "you can reach and",
        "change.",
        "",
        "Kit 0, Basic, is the",
        "init kit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Buses & sends",
      "lines": [
        "Each of the ten",
        "drums can take its",
        "own bus, and each",
        "has Send A and B",
        "into the returns.",
        "",
        "Both pads of a pair",
        "follow one drum onto",
        "one bus.",
        "",
        "WARNING: a drum on a",
        "bus leaves BEFORE",
        "Master. It keeps its",
        "own Volume, Pan and",
        "Sat but not the",
        "global Drive, Sat,",
        "limiter or Gain.",
        "",
        "Expect it to get",
        "louder, about 4dB at",
        "the default Drive.",
        "",
        "Shared glue over",
        "routed drums belongs",
        "in the bus, not on",
        "Master."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
